<!--
  A response cut off mid-document — a connection dropped between GROBID and the
  worker, or a proxy that gave up. fast-xml-parser is lenient enough to return a
  partial tree for this, which is why the parser validates before it parses:
  without that, a truncated response would arrive as an article with mysteriously
  missing metadata rather than as a failure.
-->
